OL,3,GNEWSAUnder-used park and rides could be
OL,4,Ascrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo under-used park and ride services
OL,7,Fwhich cost #1,800 a day to run could be
OL,8,Fscrapped in Preston and Lancaster.
OL,10,FThe Walton-le-Dale Park and Ride near
OL,11,FPreston and the Caton Road Park and
OL,12,FRide in Lancaster are both at risk of
OL,13,Fclosure, as the number of people using
OL,14,Fthem was below the level needed to
OL,15,Fcover their costs, Lancashire County
OL,16,FCouncil has said.
OL,18,FThe sites currently cost the council
OL,19,Fabout #550,000 a year to operate
OL,20,Fcombined, but regularly see fewer than
OL,21,Fhalf of the spaces filled.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
