OL,3,GNEWSAUnder-used park and rides could be
OL,4,Ascrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sites were established to encourage
OL,7,Fmore sustainable travel into Preston
OL,8,Fand Lancaster city centres in a bid to
OL,9,Freduce congestion and improve air
OL,10,Fquality.
